#: aboutdata.cpp:105
msgid ""
"Gpg4win is an installer package for Windows for EMail and file encryption "
"using the core component GnuPG for Windows. Both relevant cryptography "
"standards are supported, OpenPGP and S/MIME. Gpg4win and the software "
"included with Gpg4win are Free Software."
msgstr ""
"Gpg4win je Installer paket za Windows za šifrovanje e-pošte i datoteke "
"pomoću ključne komponente GnuPG  za Wndovs. Oba relevantna kriptografska "
"standarda su podržana OpenPGP i S / MIME. Gpg4win i Softver koji se "
"isporučuje sa Gpg4win  su slobodni softver."

