msgstr "OpenPGP izvoz certifikata"

#: commands/exportopenpgpcertstoservercommand.cpp:100
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>When OpenPGP certificates have been exported to a public directory "
"server, it is nearly impossible to remove them again.</para><para>Before "
"exporting your certificate to a public directory server, make sure that you "
"have created a revocation certificate so you can revoke the certificate if "
"needed later.</para><para>Are you sure you want to continue?</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Kada su OpenPGP certifikati su izvozili u javnom imeničkom serveru, to "
"je gotovo nemoguće da ih uklonimo ponovo.</para><para>Pre nego što izvezete "
"svoje certifikate na javni server direktorijuma, uvjerite se da ste kreirali "
"opoziv certifikata, tako da može da opozovete certifikat, ako je potrebno "
"kasnije </ para> <para> Jeste li sigurni da želite da nastavite.?</para>"

