#: commands/refreshopenpgpcertscommand.cpp:90
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>Refreshing OpenPGP certificates implies downloading all certificates "
"anew, to check if any of them have been revoked in the meantime.</"
"para><para>This can put a severe strain on your own as well as other "
"people's network connections, and can take up to an hour or more to "
"complete, depending on your network connection, and the number of "
"certificates to check.</para> <para>Are you sure you want to continue?</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Osvježavanje OpenPGP certifikata povlači preuzmanje svih certifikata "
"iznova, da se vidi da li su povučeni u međuvremenu.</para><para>To je "
"ozbiljno opterećenje za vaše mrežne konekcije i konekcije drugih korisnika i "
"može uzeti do dat pa i više vremena da se završi..</para> <para>Da li ste "
"sigurni da želite nastaviti?</para>"

