msgstr "Nađi:"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:29
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, unknownRB)
#: rc.cpp:369
msgid "I do not know"
msgstr "nepoznata"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:42
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_7)
#: rc.cpp:372
msgid "<i>(unknown trust)</i>"
msgstr "<i>(nepoznato povjerenje)</i>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:75
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#: rc.cpp:375
msgid ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Choose this if you have no opinion about the "
"trustworthyness of the certificate's owner.<br>Certifications at this trust "
"level are ignored when checking the validity of OpenPGP certificates.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Odaberite ovo ako ne znate koliko možete vjerovati "
"vlasniku certifikata.<br>Sertifikati poverenja na ovom nivou su ignorisani "
"kada proveravate valjanost OpenPGP sertifikata.</font>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:89
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, neverRB)
#: rc.cpp:378
msgid "I do NOT trust them"
msgstr "Ne vjerujem im"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:99
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_8)
#: rc.cpp:381
msgid "<i>(never trust)</i>"
msgstr "<i>(nikad ne vjeruj)</i>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:132
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#: rc.cpp:384
msgid ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Choose this if you explicitly do <em>not</em> trust the "
"certificate owner, e.g. because you have knowledge of him certifying without "
"checking or without the certificate owner's consent.<br>Certifications at "
"this trust level are ignored when checking the validity of OpenPGP "
"certificates.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Odaberite ovo ako eksplicitno <em>ne</em> vjerujete "
"vlasniku certifikata, npr. ako znate da on certificira bez provjere ili "
"slaganja vlasnika certifikata.<br>Certifikati na ovom nivou povjerenja se "
"ignorišu prilikom provjere validnosti OpenPGP certifikata.</font>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:146
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, marginalRB)
#: rc.cpp:387
msgid "I believe checks are casual"
msgstr "Vjerujem da su provjere povremene"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:156
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_9)
#: rc.cpp:390
msgid "<i>(marginal trust)</i>"
msgstr "<i>(marginalno povjerenje)</i>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:189
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_4)
#: rc.cpp:393
msgid ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Choose this if you trust certifications are not done "
"blindly, but not very accuratly, either.<br>Certificates will only become "
"valid with multiple certifications (typically three) at this trust level. "
"This is usually a good choice.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Izaberite ovu opciju ako imate povjerenja de se "
"certificiranje ne vrši slijepo, ali ne baš precizno, bilo.<br>Certifikat će "
"postati validan sa više certifikata (obično tri) na ovom nivou povjerenja. "
"To je obično dobar izbor.</font>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:203
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, fullRB)
#: rc.cpp:396
msgid "I believe checks are very accurate"
msgstr "Vjerujem da su provjere vrlo precizne"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:213
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_10)
#: rc.cpp:399
msgid "<i>(full trust)</i>"
msgstr "<i>(puno povjerenje)</i>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:246
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_5)
#: rc.cpp:402
msgid ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Choose this if you trust certifications are done very "
"accurately.<br>Certificates will become valid with just a single "
"certification at this trust level, so assign this much trust with care.</"
"font>"
msgstr ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Izaberite ovu opciju ako su certifikati povjerenja su "
"urađenii veoma precizno.<br>Certifikati će postati važeći sa samo jednim "
"certifikatom na ovom nivou povjerenja, tako da dodijelite ovoliko poverenje "
"sa pažnjom.</font>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:263
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, ultimateRB)
#: rc.cpp:405
msgid "This is my certificate"
msgstr "Ovo je moj certifikat"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:273
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_11)
#: rc.cpp:408
msgid "<i>(ultimate trust)</i>"
msgstr "<i>(ogromno povjerenje)</i>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ownertrustdialog.ui:306
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_6)
#: rc.cpp:411
msgid ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Choose this if and only if this is your certificate. This "
"is the default if the secret key is available, but if you imported this "
"certificate, you might need to adjust the trust level yourself."
"<br>Certificates will become valid with just a single certification at this "
"trust level.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font size=\"-1\">Izaberite ovu opciju ako i samo ako je to vaš certifikat. "
"Ovo je podrazumijevani, ako je tajni ključ  dostupan, ali ako ste uvezli "
"ovaj certifikat, možda ćete morati da podesite nivo povjerenja sami."
"<br>Certifikati će postati važeći sa samo jednom certifikacijom na ovom "
"nivou poverenja.</font>"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/selectchecklevelwidget.ui:16
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#: rc.cpp:414
msgid ""
"<b>Step 2:</b> How thoroughly have you checked that this certificate "
"actually belongs to the person it claims it is from?"
msgstr ""
"<b>Korak 2:</b> Koliko duboko ste provjerili da je ovaj sertifikat zaista "
"pripada osobi  za koji ona tvrdi da je od nje?"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/selectchecklevelwidget.ui:26
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, checkLevelNotCheckedRB)
#: rc.cpp:417
msgid "I have not checked at all"
msgstr "Nisam provjerio uopšte"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/selectchecklevelwidget.ui:52
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#: rc.cpp:420
msgid "Describe semantics here..."
msgstr "Ovdje opiši semantiku..."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/selectchecklevelwidget.ui:62
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, checkLevelCasualRB)
#: rc.cpp:423
msgid "I have checked casually"
msgstr "Provjerio sam neformalno"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/selectchecklevelwidget.ui:88
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_4)
#: rc.cpp:426
msgid ""
"Choose this if you know the person, and have asked them whether this was "
"their certificate, but you have not verified they are actually in possession "
"of the secret certificate."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovo ako poznajete osobu, i pitali je da li jei ovo bio njihov "
"certifikat, ali niste potvrdili da su ustvari u posjedu tajnog certifikata."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/selectchecklevelwidget.ui:98
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, checkLevelThoroughlyRB)
#: rc.cpp:429
msgid "I have checked very thoroughly"
msgstr "Provjerio sam veoma temeljito"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/selectchecklevelwidget.ui:124
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_5)
#: rc.cpp:432
msgid ""
"Choose this if you have, for instance, checked the ID card of the person, "
"and have verified that they are in possession of the secret key (e.g. by "
"sending them encrypted mail and asking for it to be decrypted)."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite ovo ako imate, na primer, provjerenu ličnu karte lica, a potvrđeno "
"je da su u posjedu tajnog ključa (npr. tako što im šaljete šifrovanu poštu i "
"tražeći da se dešifruje)."

