msgid "Please choose which type of certificate you want to create. "
msgstr "Molim odaberite koju vrstu certifikata želite kreirati, "

#. i18n: file: newcertificatewizard/chooseprotocolpage.ui:25
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCommandLinkButton, pgpCLB)
#: rc.cpp:638
msgid "Create a personal OpenPGP key pair"
msgstr "Kreiraj lični OpenPGP par ključeva"

#. i18n: file: newcertificatewizard/chooseprotocolpage.ui:34
#. i18n: ectx: property (description), widget (QCommandLinkButton, pgpCLB)
#: rc.cpp:641
msgid ""
"OpenPGP key pairs are created locally, and certified by your friends and "
"acquaintances. There is no central certification authority; instead, every "
"individual creates a personal Web of Trust by certifying other users' key "
"pairs with their own certificate."
msgstr ""
"OpenPGP par ključeva je lokalno stvoren, i overen od strane vaših prijatelja "
"i poznanika. Ne postoji centralni certifikacijski autoritet, umesto toga, "
"svaki pojedinac stvara ličnu mrežu poverenja koje potvrđuje parovima "
"ključeva drugih korisnika sa sopstvenim certifikatom."

#. i18n: file: newcertificatewizard/chooseprotocolpage.ui:41
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCommandLinkButton, x509CLB)
#: rc.cpp:644
msgid "Create a personal X.509 key pair and certification request "
msgstr "Kreiraj lični X.509 par ključeva i zahtjev za certifikatom "

#. i18n: file: newcertificatewizard/chooseprotocolpage.ui:50
#. i18n: ectx: property (description), widget (QCommandLinkButton, x509CLB)
#: rc.cpp:647
msgid ""
"X.509 key pairs are created locally, but certified centrally by a "
"certification authority (CA). CAs can certify other CAs, creating a central, "
"hierarchical chain of trust."
msgstr ""
"X.509 parovi ključeva su kreirani lokalno, ali certificirani centralno od "
"autoriteta za certifikaciju(CA). CAs moće certifikovati drugi CA, kreirajući "
"centralni, hijerarhijski lanac povjerenja."

