msgstr "Kreiram ključ..."

#. i18n: file: newcertificatewizard/keycreationpage.ui:8
#. i18n: ectx: property (subTitle), widget (QWizardPage, Kleo::NewCertificateUi::KeyCreationPage)
#: rc.cpp:683
